 * API test runner — canonical reference template (tx-ovra-orderdetails-service).
 * Copy to {service-repo}/api-tests/scripts/test-runner.js and set SERVICE_NAME.
 * Contract: tools/runner-contract.md in tdgs-aidlc-setup-api-tests skill.
